# Python Code Style

## Standards
- Follow PEP8.
- Add type hints for all public functions and methods.
- Add explicit return types for public callables.
- Add Google-style docstrings for public APIs.

## Naming
- Module and function names use snake_case.
- Class names use PascalCase.
- Constants use UPPER_SNAKE_CASE.

## Quality
- Avoid unexplained magic numbers.
- Keep functions small and single-purpose.
